{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406570/extras/ic_launcher-web-tiny.png?t=1687630484\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sokoban (Boxman) Classic</strong></h2><br>Boxman is an implementation of the classic box-pushing puzzle game, Sokoban. Each level has the same objective; to push boxes to their destination locations. Although this may sound simple, the progressive difficulty of the levels will certainly demand creativity, imagination and perseverance.<br><br>The rules are simple. You can only walk or push. You cannot walk through walls or over boxes and you cannot pull. There are 306 play levels. Enjoy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Player can choose between key board and mouse click mechanics<br></li><li> Intuitive controls to undo, move, and push boxes<br></li><li> Ability to save and review your path history at any stage<br></li><li> Cheap and easy access to the solution to each level<br></li><li> 306 classic levels of varying difficulty</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1406570?t=1687630484","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1687630484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1687630484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1687630484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406570/extras/ic_launcher-web-tiny.png?t=1687630484\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sokoban (Boxman) Classic</strong></h2><b